{"id":"adversarial-011","difficulty":"adversarial","title":"最大子数组和（暴力）","description":"找到连续子数组最大和。期望 Kadane O(n)。","function_signature":"def max_sub_array_adv(nums: list) -> int","entry_point":"max_sub_array_adv","constraints":"1 <= len(nums) <= 10^5","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["全负","单元素"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]],"expected":6},{"args":[[1]],"expected":1}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[-1]],"expected":-1},{"args":[[-2,-1]],"expected":-1}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"枚举所有子数组。","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"全负取最大单元素。","代码实现":"```python\ndef max_sub_array_adv(nums: list) -> int:\n    best = nums[0]\n    n = len(nums)\n    for i in range(n):\n        s = 0\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            s += nums[j]\n            if s > best: best = s\n    return best\n```","自测说明":"公开小样例通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":false,"first_error_step":"step_1_approach","error_types":["算法选择错误","复杂度分析错误"],"note":"O(n^2) 暴力"},"language":"python"}